<title>USA: Archer Daniels to buy cocoa unit - NYT.</title>
<headline>Archer Daniels to buy cocoa unit - NYT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Archer Daniels Midland Co said Monday it would buy W.R. Grace &amp; Co's cocoa business for about $430 million in cash and debt, The New York Times reported Tuesday.</p>
<p>The acquisition gives Archer Daniels the world's largest processor of cocoa beans, the story says.</p>
</text>
